  "additionalImplementationChecks": [
    "Live/start/tombstone capacity without eviction or ID reuse; complete-before-start ordering at live capacity.",
    "Start commands with identical payload allocate distinct instances; valid distinct revisions are processed in supplied order.",
    "Illegal dark completion before Leaving; cancelled or completed tasks cannot be revived.",
    "Counter overflow and malformed/unknown selectors or payloads reject atomically.",
    "ApplyUpdates while Pending rejects; updates must be part of the polling tick.",
    "All tasks complete does not implicitly release a fresh barrier, execute D4/DB, exit an event or close the scene."
  ],
